{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth depends on what orbits above it. You're the one holding it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Void Tech</i>, you play as a satellite repair technician working in open space to maintain the infrastructure that powers communication, navigation, and global systems.\u00a0<strong>When satellites fail, you are called in.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master zero-G physics as you drift, thrust, and stabilize yourself hundreds of kilometers above Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to manage oxygen, control your momentum and on top repair systems while being suspended hundreds of kilometers above Earth. Every movement counts. Every resource matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as you complete contracts for Space agencies and Private Companies, something doesn't add up. Corrupted data, missing satellites and encrypted HDDs are telling a different story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic zero G</strong> <strong>movement</strong>:<br>Drift, thrust, and stabilize yourself. Every movement matters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair, don't replace</strong><br>Reduce debris and extend satellite lifespan through hands-on repair gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Space</strong><br>Keep your eyes open for solar storms, drifting fragments, system failures and much more.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A subtle unfolding story</strong><br>Investigate hidden logs and decide how deep you\u2019re willing to dig.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585900?t=1771922453","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_